# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TEST 9: Application Config Not Hidden
# Application configuration should be visible (not hidden)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
META
    esp_id `win-app-config-visible`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    control_framework `CUSTOM`
    control `APP-CONFIG-001`
    control_mapping `CUSTOM:APP-CONFIG-001`
    title `Application configuration must be visible`
    description `Application configuration files should not be hidden, as this could indicate tampering or malicious modification.`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `low`
    agent_type `endpoint`
    tags `application,config,hidden,visibility`
META_END

DEF
    OBJECT app_config
        path `C:\ProgramData\MyApp\config.ini`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE config_visible
        exists boolean = true
        is_hidden boolean = false
        readable boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST at_least_one all
            STATE_REF config_visible
            OBJECT_REF app_config
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
